# Product context

Full Arabic PRD: [`docs/PRODUCT_REQUIREMENTS_AR.md`](docs/PRODUCT_REQUIREMENTS_AR.md)

**Goal:** Field control of medical reps — real routes, accurate visits/DCR, samples & gifts custody.

**Visit kinds:**
- `Planning` — multi-select accounts → set time → admin approval → becomes `Planned`
- `Planned` — pre-approved plan
- `Unplanned` — same-day ad-hoc

**Account** on Visit is a free-form `String` (doctor / clinic / hospital / …), not a sealed type.

**Also:** multi-tenant + device binding, anti-fake GPS, offline auto-sync, pending Continue/Cancel card, check-in/out via first/last visit, account create requests, leaves/expenses.

When modeling visits, prefer sealed `Visit` with shared core fields; keep workflow status separate from sync status; no `ByteArray`/`Uri` on domain.
